---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Badge from "../components/Badge.astro";
import SectionContainer from "../components/SectionContainer.astro";
import LinkedInIcon from "../components/icons/LinkedIn.astro";
import SocialPill from "../components/icons/SocialPill.astro";
import GithubIcon from "../components/icons/Github.astro";
import MailIcon from "../components/icons/Mail.astro";
import Experience from "../components/Experience.astro";
import Briefcase from "../components/icons/Briefcase.astro";
import CodeIcon from "../components/icons/Code.astro";
import Projects from "../components/Projects.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Portfolio de Danilo Maccari"
  description="Desarrollador Full Stack"
  lang="es"
>
  <main class="px-4">
    <SectionContainer class="py-28 pb-32">
      <h1
        class="text-black dark:text-white text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold flex flex-row gap-x-4 pb-6 lg:pb-10"
      >
        <span data-lang="es">¡Hola, soy Danilo Maccari!</span>
        <span data-lang="en" class="hidden">Hi, I'm Danilo Maccari!</span>
        <a
          href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maccari78/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
          class="flex justify-center items-center"
        >
          <Badge>
            <span data-lang="es">Disponible para trabajar</span>
            <span data-lang="en" class="hidden">Available for work</span>
          </Badge>
        </a>
      </h1>
      <h2 class="text-lg lg:text-xl font-semibold text-wrap max-w-[700px] mb-3">
        <span data-lang="es">Desarrollador Full Stack | Ruby on Rails 8 · Python FastAPI · React Native | AWS · Kubernetes | Sistemas de Escala Gubernamental | HealthTech SaaS en producción</span>
        <span data-lang="en" class="hidden">Full Stack Developer | Ruby on Rails 8 · Python FastAPI · React Native | AWS · Kubernetes | Government-Scale Systems | HealthTech SaaS in Production</span>
      </h2>
      <div data-lang="es" class="max-w-[700px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4">
        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-wrap">
          Desarrollador Full Stack con experiencia en <span class="font-semibold">sistemas de producción críticos</span>. Fui el único desarrollador a cargo de <span class="font-semibold">IPS RUPA</span>, plataforma gubernamental provincial (Django + Next.js + PostgreSQL) con millones de registros de afiliados, empleadores y salarios. Gestioné todas las etapas: API REST, migración de frontend, adaptación a schema legacy inamovible (Adabas D → PostgreSQL), integración de +90 GB de datos con Celery y Streaming, y deploy en Kubernetes (OKD/OpenShift) coordinado con DevOps.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-wrap">
          Paralelamente, fundé y desarrollé <span class="font-semibold">DocSync</span>, un SaaS de gestión de clínicas médicas con arquitectura multi-tenant (Row Level Security en PostgreSQL), hoy en producción en AWS y con app mobile aprobada en Google Play. Esta misma experiencia en arquitecturas multi-tenant la apliqué también en otros proyectos freelance, transformando MVPs mono-cuenta en SaaS escalables para múltiples clientes. Sólido en código limpio, seguridad y entrega continua, con foco en llevar productos de idea a producción real.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="en" class="hidden max-w-[700px] text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-4">
        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-wrap">
          Full Stack Developer with experience in <span class="font-semibold">critical production systems</span>. I was the sole developer responsible for <span class="font-semibold">IPS RUPA</span>, a provincial government platform (Django + Next.js + PostgreSQL) handling millions of records for members, employers, and payroll. I managed every stage: REST API design, frontend migration, adaptation to an immovable legacy schema (Adabas D → PostgreSQL), integration of 90+ GB of production data with Celery and streaming, and deployment on Kubernetes (OKD/OpenShift) coordinated with the DevOps team.
        </p>
        <p class="text-base lg:text-lg text-wrap">
          In parallel, I founded and built <span class="font-semibold">DocSync</span>, a medical clinic management SaaS with multi-tenant architecture (PostgreSQL Row Level Security), now live in production on AWS with a mobile app approved on Google Play. I've applied this same multi-tenant expertise across other freelance projects, turning single-account MVPs into scalable, multi-client SaaS products. Strong focus on clean code, security, and continuous delivery, with an emphasis on taking products from idea to real production.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul>
        <nav class="flex gap-4 mt-8 flex-wrap">
          <SocialPill href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/maccari78/">
            <LinkedInIcon class="size-4 md:size-6" />LinkedIn
          </SocialPill>
          <SocialPill href="https://github.com/maccari78">
            <GithubIcon class="size-4 md:size-6" />Github
          </SocialPill>
          <SocialPill href="mailto:maccari78@gmail.com">
            <MailIcon class="size-4 md:size-6" />maccari78@gmail.com
          </SocialPill>
        </nav>
      </ul>
      <div class="flex gap-4 mt-6 flex-wrap justify-start">
        <a
          href="/cv/2026-07-23 MaccariDaniloCV ES.pdf"
          download="2026-07-23 MaccariDaniloCV ES.pdf"
          class="flex items-center"
        >
          <Badge
            class="px-4 py-2 text-sm md:text-base hover:bg-blue-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Descargar CV (Español)
          </Badge>
        </a>
        <a
          href="/cv/2026-07-23 MaccariDaniloCV EN.pdf"
          download="2026-07-23 MaccariDaniloCV EN.pdf"
          class="flex items-center"
        >
          <Badge
            class="px-4 py-2 text-sm md:text-base hover:bg-blue-200 dark:hover:bg-gray-700 transition-colors"
          >
            Download CV (English)
          </Badge>
        </a>
      </div>
    </SectionContainer>
    <SectionContainer id="experiencia">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6 flex gap-x-2 items-center">
        <Briefcase class="size-7" />
        <span data-lang="es">Experiencia profesional</span>
        <span data-lang="en" class="hidden">Professional Experience</span>
      </h2>
      <Experience />
    </SectionContainer>
    <SectionContainer id="proyectos">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold mb-6 flex gap-x-2 items-center">
        <CodeIcon class="size-7" />
        <span data-lang="es">Proyectos</span>
        <span data-lang="en" class="hidden">Projects</span>
      </h2>
      <Projects />
    </SectionContainer>
  </main>
</Layout>
